# Traefik routes

List and craft routers, services, middlewares, TLS options, and Kubernetes
`IngressRoute` / Middleware CRDs (or file/Docker labels). Prefer MCP when
connected; else Traefik API or checked-in manifests.

Never invent router / service / middleware names — list/resolve first. After
changes, report rule host/path + service + entrypoint + TLS state (no tokens).
